+## Overview
+
+Total revenue across the dataset is $7,154.44 from 30 orders, an average of about $238 per order. The median order value is $204.94, indicating steady mid-sized orders rather than a few large outliers.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget leads with $2,392.00 in revenue, followed by Widget at $2,118.94. Doohickey ($1,513.00) and Sprocket ($1,130.50) trail. High-priced Gadget drives value despite lower unit volume, while lower-cost Widget sells largely on volume.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North is the strongest region at $2,176.35, ahead of East ($1,830.79) and South ($1,732.48). West lags at $1,414.82, roughly 35% below North. Revenue is fairly balanced, with no single region dominating overall sales.
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Prioritize Gadget inventory and marketing, since it generates the most revenue ($2,392.00) despite modest unit volume.
+- Investigate West's underperformance ($1,414.82) and apply North's successful tactics to close the regional gap.
+- Bundle high-volume Widget with premium Gadget to raise median order value above the current $204.94.
